Z||000022||Shaun41178||06-27-2001||09:13 PM||||Nothing against dragstrip dyno or what not 88Formula but that is why I never really take to heart the numbers you lay out from your program about hp and accelereation figures.  Its not real life and that is the best proover of all.<P>Which is why I think the 3.2 can layout around 180 hp with good head mods and how the focoa headers added like 20 hp to your 3.4.  Hehehe doubt it.  Program says the 3.2 never really gets higher then 170 if I am not mistaken with most of the common numbers piucnhed in untill you add headers and then amazingly itis up around 200.  That program woudlnt' know that.  I don't think it would give 20 hp.<P>Not bashing you, just bashing the program||||reg||1
